OL,3,GNEWSABudget a 'mixed bag' for
OL,4,Aindependent businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent restaurant owner has
OL,7,Fsaid the chancellor's Budget has not
OL,8,Fgone far enough for small businesses.
OL,10,FKenny Mann, who runs Limas in Long
OL,11,FEaton, Derbyshire, said the raft of
OL,12,Fannouncements on Wednesday was a "mixed
OL,13,Fbag" and felt more could have been done
OL,14,Fto help small firms.
OL,16,FHe welcomed the relief on businesses
OL,17,Frates, but added the increase of the
OL,18,Fminimum wage of 3.9% in April would
OL,19,Feffectively cancel it out.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
