OL,3,GNEWSABudget a 'mixed bag' for
OL,4,Aindependent businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC, Mann said: "Small
OL,7,Fbusinesses and independents are really
OL,8,Fgoing to struggle, I think, moving
OL,9,Fforward."
